mapping "Y284.1" source="Y284" target="219342006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source Y284 = Swedish ICD-10-SE national extension of Y28 SNOMED CT 219342006 (Athena ICD10 concept
        45756511), refined by Swedish external-cause place axis: gata och väg (street and highway); no
        specific activity axis (place-only code). The clinical event/exposure is unchanged; the Swedish
        place/activity qualifiers are external-cause metadata with no distinct standard SNOMED CT clinical
        analogue. Target SNOMED CT 4072226 = sctid 219342006. Why this target: Athena ICD10 crosswalk maps
        base Y28 (concept_id 45756511) -> 4072226 (relationship 45756511, 4072226); it is the
        authoritative standard concept for Y28 and fully subsumes every place/activity-specific SE
        subdivision. mapping_type=broader (target fully contains every clinical meaning of the source;
        the dropped qualifier is breadth-neutral external-cause metadata, not a partial slice).
        Confidence (high): verified Athena crosswalk on the base code with a small, well-understood
        one-level breadth mismatch (the SE place/activity refinement is lost). Athena-local research
        only.
        """
}
mapping "Y2840.1" source="Y2840" target="219342006" relationship=source_is_broader_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        curated re-elevation (narrower): Source Y2840 = contact with sharp object, undetermined intent
        (ext of Y28) + street + sport. Target 4072226 SNOMED CT 219342006 (std=S) is the Y28 crosswalk
        target. Intent matches (unknown), agent matches (sharp), but target asserts an INJURY whereas
        source is a CONTACT event. Target more specific narrower. RE-ELEVATION.
